OL,5,G1000 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,6,     FWhen a tawny owl interrupts Peter
OL,7,     FWright's bridge night at his
OL,8,     Fvillage hall, all eyes are on the
OL,9,     Fvet. The little owl has been hit
OL,10,     Fby a car, so the cards are stacked
OL,11,     Fagainst him.
OL,12,G1100 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen journeys to South America to
OL,14,     Fvisit Rhona, a Brit actress who
OL,15,     Fleft Hollywood to live alone in a
OL,16,     Fremote Uruguay valley, having
OL,17,     Fbecome disillusioned with
OL,18,     FTinseltown life.
