OL,13,     FBen heads to an island at the edge
OL,14,     Fof the world on Norway's arctic
OL,15,     Fcoastline, and meets Elena, a
OL,16,     Fformer Middle East peacekeeper who
OL,17,     Fhas created her dream home here.
